Header header
string name # (optional) waypoint name
geometry_msgs/Point position # 3D point in [m]
float64 yaw # yaw/heading in [rad]
bool absolute_coords # 'true' if the position is provided in absolute coordinates, 'false' when it is provided in relative coordinates
---
bool success   # indicate successful run of triggered service
string message # informational, e.g. for error messages
